{"strongs": "H0074", "word": "אֲבִינֵר", "translit": "av.ner", "root": "אבה", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "my father is Nêr", "definition": "אֲבִינֵר proper name, masculine ( my father is Nêr , or is a lamp compare 2Sam 21:17 accusative to Lag BN 75 = אֲבֶן (= בֶּן ) + נֵר = son of Ner; compare ᵐ5 Ἀβεννηρ ) — so only 1Sam 14:50 , elsewhere אַבְנֵר — cousin of Saul, and captain of his host 1Sam 14:50 ; 1Sam 14:51 ; 1Sam 17:55 (3 t. in verse) + 52 t. 1 & 2 Samuel; + 1Kgs 2:5 ; 1Kgs 2:32 ; 1Chr 26:28 ; 1Chr 27:21 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB34')\">BDB34</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H74')\">H74</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB33')\">BDB33</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB35')\">BDB35</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֲבִינֵר</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>my father is Nêr</highlight>, or <highlight>is a lamp</highlight> compare <ref ref=\"2Sam 21:17\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(10,21,17)\">2Sam 21:17</ref> accusative to <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>BN 75</sup></lookup> = <bdbheb>אֲבֶן</bdbheb> (= <bdbheb>בֶּן</bdbheb>) + <bdbheb>נֵר</bdbheb> = son of Ner; compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ἀβεννηρ</grk>) — so only <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:50\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"50\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"50\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,50)\">1Sam 14:50</ref>, elsewhere <bdbheb>אַבְנֵר</bdbheb> — cousin of Saul, and captain of his host <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:50\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"50\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"50\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,50)\">1Sam 14:50</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:51\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"51\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"51\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,51)\">1Sam 14:51</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:55\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"55\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"55\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,55)\">1Sam 17:55</ref> (3 t. in verse) + 52 t. 1 &amp; 2 Samuel; + <ref ref=\"1Kgs 2:5\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(11,2,5)\">1Kgs 2:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 2:32\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(11,2,32)\">1Kgs 2:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 26:28\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(13,26,28)\">1Chr 26:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 27:21\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(13,27,21)\">1Chr 27:21</ref>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Sam 21:17", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 21, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "1Sam 14:50", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 14, "verse": 50}, {"raw": "1Sam 14:51", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 14, "verse": 51}, {"raw": "1Sam 17:55", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 17, "verse": 55}, {"raw": "1Kgs 2:5", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 2, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "1Kgs 2:32", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 2, "verse": 32}, {"raw": "1Chr 26:28", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 26, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "1Chr 27:21", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 27, "verse": 21}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["אֲבִינֵר", "אֲבֶן", "בֶּן", "נֵר", "ᵐ5", "אַבְנֵר"], "aramaic": [], "greek": ["Ἀβεννηρ"], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Lag", "Sept"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB34", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}